Package: erhai-mesa
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Erwin <yzddmr7@gmail.com>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: Freedreno desktop driver for the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro
 Private Mesa libraries with the upstream Adreno 830v1 device entry.
 GNOME and systemd user sessions select this driver at their next start;
 distribution libraries remain owned and updated by Ubuntu. Includes desktop
 OpenGL and GLES, without Vulkan or a software renderer. Removing this package
 restores distribution driver selection at the next session start.
